{"matched":53,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0407a01","n":"0407a","t":"法見相應此若初位必有此位"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0407b01","n":"0407b","t":"非法觀果由此應說隣近果者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0408a01","n":"0408a","t":"亦不俱起今此不違故許俱起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0408b01","n":"0408b","t":"前有漏心間不同八地自下第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0408c01","n":"0408c","t":"染心何故不起煩惱人執何法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0409c01","n":"0409c","t":"前後有俱常施食等今大乘云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0410a01","n":"0410a","t":"心無漏真智攝論無著本第一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0410b01","n":"0410b","t":"上破小乘下因解不共之義述"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0410c01","n":"0410c","t":"不共何故無明名為不共謂從"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0411a01","n":"0411a","t":"無如不共法非二乘共不言自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0411b01","n":"0411b","t":"無也其第二獨行不共則與忿"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0412a01","n":"0412a","t":"意識亦爾所難同喻不成者謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0412b01","n":"0412b","t":"處所攝意言顯是意處所攝恐"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0413a01","n":"0413a","t":"體故若爾彼應似現識名識如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0413b01","n":"0413b","t":"想定而不欣入在聖滅故一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0413c01","n":"0413c","t":"故除經部師餘部救言述曰長"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0414a01","n":"0414a","t":"文於中有三一顯自我執二破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0414b01","n":"0414b","t":"謂相縛謂於境相不能了知依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0414c01","n":"0414c","t":"漏故善心無覆既與煩惱不俱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0415a01","n":"0415a","t":"行煩惱我執俱故雖有種逐無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0415c01","n":"0415c","t":"別第一出能變差別第二自性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0416a01","n":"0416a","t":"說問辨識得名實通根境何為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0416b01","n":"0416b","t":"色種子識種隨之此如何等此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0416c01","n":"0416c","t":"意色二所依故若爾七八二識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0417a01","n":"0417a","t":"獨所了以得彼名故唯第六識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0417b01","n":"0417b","t":"地或即初地或入八地此是本"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0417c01","n":"0417c","t":"其身化中佛地經說現業果化"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0418a01","n":"0418a","t":"二初釋頌後會經此初也如前"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0418b01","n":"0418b","t":"第二卷解若自在五識見分境"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0418c01","n":"0418c","t":"名下自別出且何名為善述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0419a01","n":"0419a","t":"種子隨現行彼性中攝然此二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0419b01","n":"0419b","t":"種種所緣境意識故二由此俱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0419c01","n":"0419c","t":"俱此如何等如眼識緣善色至"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0420a01","n":"0420a","t":"欲界聲等境也六十五等說廣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0420b01","n":"0420b","t":"不定同性定中意是善與耳性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0420c01","n":"0420c","t":"通善等又五識必由尋伺所引"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0421a01","n":"0421a","t":"爾初地已去五識之中尚有不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0421b01","n":"0421b","t":"儀即今大乘亦通五識有威儀"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0421c01","n":"0421c","t":"句顯一切心所得名心所第二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0422a01","n":"0422a","t":"作意一法獨能取彼眾多別相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0422b01","n":"0422b","t":"等顯揚十八有頌說此五及心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0422c01","n":"0422c","t":"知或俱不俱別事生故述曰十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0423a01","n":"0423a","t":"若如初說從多分或加行等說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0423b01","n":"0423b","t":"中唯以苦根於學無學身中無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0424a01","n":"0424a","t":"二種可有此性如率爾等五心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0424b01","n":"0424b","t":"不遍五根故但適意識及身處"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0424c01","n":"0424c","t":"慼受皆名憂故此長徒義若言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0425a01","n":"0425a","t":"獄相似五十七說與地獄同純"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0425b01","n":"0425b","t":"根或現不成斷善不斷善有一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0425c01","n":"0425c","t":"識有時無故不成意根其六轉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0426a01","n":"0426a","t":"今言生彼定則成就且如男根"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0427a01","n":"0427a","t":"七卷更有異釋應引彼文述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0427b01","n":"0427b","t":"地皆有無漏八識耶答有若爾"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷005b","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":120,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}